  "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">PORTARIA N&ordm; CBPM&ndash;030/ADM/2025, DE 25 DE SETEMBRO DE 2025.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><em style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Disp&otilde;e sobre designa&ccedil;&atilde;o de interlocutor de correi&ccedil;&atilde;o da CBPM na forma da Resolu&ccedil;&atilde;o CGE n&ordm; 32/2025.</em></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: justify; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">O Presidente da Caixa Beneficente da Pol&iacute;cia Militar do Estado - CBPM, no uso de suas atribui&ccedil;&otilde;es previstas no Inciso VIII, do Artigo 6&deg; do anexo do Decreto n&deg; 69.591, de 9 de junho de 2025, c/c o inciso XIV, do artigo 8&ordm; da Portaria n&ordm; CBPM 022/ADM/2025, de 28 de julho de 2025 &ndash; Regimento Interno da CBPM,</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">DESIGNA:</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: justify; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">LUCIANE SORAYA PEREIRA DIAS, CPF: 101.814.858-26, Superintendente de Demandas Judiciais, como interlocutora de correi&ccedil;&atilde;o com a Corregedoria Geral do Estado, o &oacute;rg&atilde;o central do Sistema de &Eacute;tica e Responsabiliza&ccedil;&atilde;o Paulista (SER Paulista), consoante previs&atilde;o do &sect; 1&ordm;, do artigo 3&ordm; da Resolu&ccedil;&atilde;o CGE n&ordm; 32/2025.</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">LEVI CLEMENTE DOS SANTOS</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Cel PM Presidente</p>",
